        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture ไม่มีเซิร์ฟเวอร์ใดที่จัดเก็บกระเป๋า ยอดคงเหลือ ธุรกรรม หรือที่อยู่ของคุณ"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture'ün cüzdanınızı, bakiyelerinizi, işlemlerinizi veya adreslerinizi saklayan hiçbir sunucusu yoktur."
