    "Aperture ships zero third-party Swift packages. Every cryptographic primitive is an Apple-shipped framework (CryptoKit, Security, LocalAuthentication).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture stuur geen derdeparty-Swift-pakkette saam nie. Elke kriptografiese primitief is 'n raamwerk wat Apple verskaf (CryptoKit, Security, LocalAuthentication)."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستخدم Aperture أي حزم Swift من جهات خارجية. كل بدائيات التشفير تأتي من أطر عمل توفّرها Apple (CryptoKit وSecurity وLocalAuthentication)."
          }
        },
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture не съдържа никакви Swift пакети от трети страни. Всеки криптографски примитив е рамка, доставяна от Apple (CryptoKit, Security, LocalAuthentication)."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture-এ কোনো থার্ড-পার্টি Swift প্যাকেজ নেই। প্রতিটি ক্রিপ্টোগ্রাফিক প্রিমিটিভ আসে Apple-এর দেওয়া ফ্রেমওয়ার্ক থেকে (CryptoKit, Security, LocalAuthentication)।"
          }
        },
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperture no inclou cap paquet de Swift de tercers. Cada primitiu criptogràfic prové d'un framework distribuït per Apple (CryptoKit, Security, LocalAuthentication)."
