          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "กระเป๋าเงินนี้ยังไม่มีที่อยู่ \\(chain.displayName) จึงไม่มีที่ให้รับบนเครือข่ายนี้ Aperture อาจยังกำลังสร้างบัญชีของคุณ — ลองอีกครั้งในอีกสักครู่"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bu cüzdanın henüz bir \\(chain.displayName) adresi yok, bu nedenle bu ağda alım yapılacak bir yer bulunmuyor. Aperture hesaplarınızı hâlâ türetiyor olabilir — biraz sonra tekrar deneyin."
